# The compiled api-worker bundle the test pool loads as an auxiliary worker lands in dist/api/ (root
# .gitignore + the eslint flat config both already ignore **/dist/**, so the ~1.5 MB artifact never commits
# or lints). Produced by the `pretest` script (`wrangler deploy --dry-run --outdir`) because
# vitest-pool-workers auxiliary Workers CANNOT be TypeScript entrypoints — they must be pre-compiled to JS.
dist/
